This project does NOT embed or redistribute font binary files.
At runtime, the browser loads webfont CSS/files from Google Fonts
(fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com), with fonts.loli.net as
a fallback mirror for the same open families.

All listed families are available on Google Fonts under the
SIL Open Font License (OFL), Version 1.1 (or compatible open terms
as published on Google Fonts for that family).

